                            "mięsień"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c24279d-9ab5-4b9a-9f00-97a97b442cc8",
                                "sense_id": "b1bf2bfc-6a1f-34b2-9c28-df8e14d03ab8",
                                "text": "Mateusz chętnie pokazuje dziewczynom swoje okazałe muskuły."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3cb1c472-fd32-446c-bf1a-036e37d5fb84",
                        "source_entry_id": "7604603e-9101-3998-ad0c-3672cb633b58",
                        "source_sense_id": "b1bf2bfc-6a1f-34b2-9c28-df8e14d03ab8",
                        "target_lang_word": "muscle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "muscle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c39add7c-854d-3944-8930-7b9b81350900",
                                        "entry_id": "4466b906-5f48-387c-b367-cdb1ddf29d34",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A contractile form of tissue which animals use to effect movement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19239b28-5d5c-40e6-8a6c-7b35a848584d",
                                                "sense_id": "c39add7c-854d-3944-8930-7b9b81350900",
                                                "text": "Muscle consists largely of actin and myosin filaments."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4847a34-ed4d-4e30-b809-d084549920f0",
                                                "sense_id": "c39add7c-854d-3944-8930-7b9b81350900",
                                                "text": "For as the Trunk of the Body, is kept from tilting forvvard by the Muſcules of the Back: So, from falling backvvard, by theſe of the Belly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7138e778-4b9f-3e50-a02e-f16c1a59e751",
                                        "entry_id": "4466b906-5f48-387c-b367-cdb1ddf29d34",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An organ composed of muscle tissue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7acad9d4-8954-476a-93a7-5a8c175dbe9e",
                                                "sense_id": "7138e778-4b9f-3e50-a02e-f16c1a59e751",
                                                "text": "His brow and hair and the palms of his hands were wet, and there was a kind of nervous contraction of his muscles. They seemed to ripple and string tense."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8adfe961-2bf3-4633-88fc-15a1568f23ef",
                                                "sense_id": "7138e778-4b9f-3e50-a02e-f16c1a59e751",
                                                "text": "You, Boxer, the very day that those great muscles of yours lose their power, Jones will sell you to the knacker […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "515b8755-0313-39b6-a0d5-f4103e65ce75",
                                        "entry_id": "4466b906-5f48-387c-b367-cdb1ddf29d34",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A well-developed physique, in which the muscles are enlarged from exercise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "plural-normally",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dda11ffb-84fa-44e8-b8a2-3c9692e164df",
                                                "sense_id": "515b8755-0313-39b6-a0d5-f4103e65ce75",
                                                "text": "2008, Lou Schuler, \"Foreward\", in Nate Green, Built for Show, page xii\nThe fact that I was middle-aged, bald, married, and raising girls instead of chasing them didn't really bother me. Muscles are cool at any age."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "07cc9b91-93e1-3cde-8b8f-b9333421e5b2",
                                        "entry_id": "4466b906-5f48-387c-b367-cdb1ddf29d34",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Strength, force."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "807dbbc2-f853-4848-9ad3-ccbe201f03f2",
                                                "sense_id": "07cc9b91-93e1-3cde-8b8f-b9333421e5b2",
                                                "text": "The widely-backed campaign to recall Evan Mecham as governor of Arizona gained even more muscle when the state House of Representatives voted to impeach the ultraconservative on February 5."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b10bcdd-6ffa-4ee0-9e95-75d4e29cf68b",
                                                "sense_id": "07cc9b91-93e1-3cde-8b8f-b9333421e5b2",
                                                "text": "The lesson to be drawn from the events of 1914, to Roosevelt's mind, was that civilization needed muscle to defend it, not just solemn words."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d0f1d9c-1786-490b-9ac4-396d0369f21e",
                                                "sense_id": "07cc9b91-93e1-3cde-8b8f-b9333421e5b2",
                                                "text": "It was going to take muscle to pluck Miss Agnes out of the canal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c00a3714-f31e-48ba-a46f-67523511e0d0",
                                                "sense_id": "07cc9b91-93e1-3cde-8b8f-b9333421e5b2",
                                                "text": "How can the unions - or more specifically the RMT—possibly think this is a good time to exert a bit of industrial muscle and indulge in strikes both on the national railway and the London Underground?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f495d03d-45d0-39c1-a5cc-2db49b3598b3",
                                        "entry_id": "4466b906-5f48-387c-b367-cdb1ddf29d34",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hired strongmen or bodyguards."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6603d7b0-e2aa-44bd-83ee-4edaa55c12ee",
                                                "sense_id": "f495d03d-45d0-39c1-a5cc-2db49b3598b3",
                                                "text": "It was easy enough to dodge him, let him crash into the floorboards. Peltroc knew that his priority was the leader, not the hired muscle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "muscle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a6b3c93-b177-36d7-9746-f92089adb773",
                                        "entry_id": "caa8f8fd-4674-3749-847c-5d4d6ca5d879",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To use force to make progress, especially physical force."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8e345fb-c64e-4cf5-8ef4-a53564cf60cf",
                                                "sense_id": "3a6b3c93-b177-36d7-9746-f92089adb773",
                                                "text": "He muscled his way through the crowd."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb3d29b1-378b-4b62-897c-85e93ce9c422",
                                                "sense_id": "3a6b3c93-b177-36d7-9746-f92089adb773",
                                                "text": "Hensel and Wilson hit a series of leg shots simultaneously as Christian muscles between them with Quinn right on his heels."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ca59e96-9a7a-41c1-988a-5d66f697a329",
                                                "sense_id": "3a6b3c93-b177-36d7-9746-f92089adb773",
                                                "text": "Nothing the Nebraskans ever again recorded managed to muscle more than minimal attention."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ad7ae02-4545-46e8-b225-a722c5c562ee",
                                                "sense_id": "3a6b3c93-b177-36d7-9746-f92089adb773",
                                                "text": "\"Here!\" I passed out stacks of money. T.C. hadn't had time to batch it up, so some of it was just laying loose in money bags and I passed all that shit out to Rome while Pimp muscled Miss Lady around."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed827daa-bcd4-3f66-af8b-405c28dae633",
                                        "entry_id": "caa8f8fd-4674-3749-847c-5d4d6ca5d879",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move forcefully or with great strength."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7fe2c77-c9e4-4aae-b966-ac767dd2fc4d",
                                                "sense_id": "ed827daa-bcd4-3f66-af8b-405c28dae633",
                                                "text": "She muscled through the ruins."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a5aab2f6-03ce-4183-9bfb-f298543a4e8e",
                        "source_entry_id": "7604603e-9101-3998-ad0c-3672cb633b58",
